==Notes==

*Added in the [[expansion pack]]s.
*By default, NWN allows spellcasting while using ''expertise''. However, [[BioWare]] included a switch to disable it via scripting using [[spellhook]]ing.
**Under the default behavior, this can be a useful feat for casters who do not make attacks, as they will gain the AC benefit at effectively no cost.
*This is an often overlooked feat, but it can be incredibly useful to fighters facing very damaging enemies (or several annoying enemies).
*This combat mode cannot be used while wielding a [[ranged weapon]].